{"id":"1f138bee947a765f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Tail Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence — ZFC Seq Tail Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence — ZFC Seq Tail Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence — ZFC Seq Tail Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s,n,A\\in V\">\\(t,s,n,A\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span> (omega-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqTailSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqTailSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}tail\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqTailSequence}_S(t,s,n,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(t,A)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(t(m)=s(n+m))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}tail\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqTailSequence}_S(t,s,n,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(t,A)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(t(m)=s(n+m))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>尾序列重新以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为定义域，并显式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 都是取值于同一集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S$ (omega-sequence predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t,s,n,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqTailSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}tail\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqTailSequence}_S(t,s,n,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(t,A)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;(t(m)=s(n+m))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":986,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3359","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-seq-tail-sequence]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d490b03448142d4c"]}